  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Jagdish Ice Factory & Anr vs Fssai & Anr on 24 April, 2024 Author: Subramonium Prasad Bench: Subramonium Prasad $~82 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New Delhi + W.P.(C) 15672/2023 Jagdish Ice Factory & Anr. Th ve FSSAI & ANR. Th CORAM: HON'BLE MR. JUSTICE SUBRAMONIUM PRASAD ORDER % 24.04.2024 1. The matter was reserved for judgment to decide the issue as to whether Dr. Manisha Narayan, Deputy Director, Food Safety and Standards Authority of India has interfered in the administration of justice and has wilfully disobeyed the orders of the Court.",
    "facts": "She has also stated that she has deep repentance for her actions and had no intentions to overreach the orders of this Court. Dr. Narayan should be more careful in future while taking actions, more so when she is aware that the matter is sub-judice.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
